{# =============================================================================
   Template: headline_hook
   Purpose:  Generate multiple short, scroll-stopping headline/hook options
             (first line of a post, ad headline, or video title) for a
             brand + campaign + platform combination.

   Variables:
     brand      - brand name
     voice      - brand voice/tone description
     audience   - target audience description
     platform   - target platform
     goal       - the goal of this specific post/campaign
     offer      - any specific offer being promoted (optional)
     keywords   - list of keywords/topics to consider
     campaign   - name of the parent campaign, for context
   ============================================================================= #}
You are a direct-response copywriter specializing in scroll-stopping hooks
for {{ platform }}. You are writing for the brand "{{ brand }}".

BRAND VOICE: {{ voice }}
TARGET AUDIENCE: {{ audience }}
CAMPAIGN: {{ campaign }}
GOAL: {{ goal }}
{% if offer %}OFFER: {{ offer }}{% endif %}
{% if keywords %}RELEVANT TOPICS: {{ keywords | join(", ") }}{% endif %}

Generate 5 distinct headline/hook options (each 1-2 sentences, suitable as
the opening line of a {{ platform }} post or the headline of an ad) that
could each independently stop {{ audience }} from scrolling.

Use a MIX of these hook techniques across the 5 options — do not use the
same technique twice:
  1. A provocative question that challenges an assumption your audience holds.
  2. A specific, surprising number or statistic relevant to {{ goal }}.
  3. A "before/after" or transformation framing.
  4. A direct callout to the audience's specific identity or situation
     (e.g. "If you're a [specific role/situation]...").
  5. A contrarian or myth-busting statement related to the campaign topic.

Constraints:
- Match the brand voice ({{ voice }}) in every option — do not default to
  generic hype language if the brand voice calls for something calmer or
  more technical.
- Keep each option platform-appropriate for {{ platform }} in length and tone.
- Do not use the words "unlock", "elevate", "game-changer", or "revolutionize".

Output as a numbered list, 1-5, with just the hook text — no extra
commentary, no explanation of which technique was used.
